{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEND DEMONS BACK TO HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On release Blood Moon Massacre will feature the Eternal Night and Deathfrost maps. Battle demons, vampires, and other creatures of the night as you attempt to survive these nightmarish hellscapes. Additional maps and Steam leaderboards will arrive in updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A FORTRESS, SET TRAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns and grenades may not be enough to defend yourself against the endless onslaught of monsters honing in on your location, you'll need traps. Build a fortress using barricades, spinning blades, trap doors, attack drones, and other contraptions to fend off the horde and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an all-out, guns-blazing commando, a technician that can utilize enhanced traps and gadgets, or mix and match skills from any of the four unique classes to suit your play style and become the ultimate survivor. Additional classes will be released in updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's important for us to build the game the community wants, so Blood Moon Massacre will launch in Early Access to gather player feedback as early in the development cycle as possible. Currently there are two playable survivors and two maps in Blood Moon Massacre, but new survivors, maps, weapons, classes, and multiplayer will be added over time. Sometime after launch, a road map will be posted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852210?t=1758378598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852210?t=1758378598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/06519f2a551d0ccd627460e7de55d2131b9a3d6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758378598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/06519f2a551d0ccd627460e7de55d2131b9a3d6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758378598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3948630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEND DEMONS BACK TO HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On release Blood Moon Massacre will feature the Eternal Night and Deathfrost maps. Battle demons, vampires, and other creatures of the night as you attempt to survive these nightmarish hellscapes. Additional maps and Steam leaderboards will arrive in updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/d7f423584f8d12c93017a7167da86cea.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A FORTRESS, SET TRAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns and grenades may not be enough to defend yourself against the endless onslaught of monsters honing in on your location, you'll need traps. Build a fortress using barricades, spinning blades, trap doors, attack drones, and other contraptions to fend off the horde and survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/14d01f6371c635e7ae907b74453af0b5.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an all-out, guns-blazing commando, a technician that can utilize enhanced traps and gadgets, or mix and match skills from any of the four unique classes to suit your play style and become the ultimate survivor. Additional classes will be released in updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.poster.avif?t=1758378598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.webm?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852210/extras/cab8967e24bc55bc95d759c27f90db70.mp4?t=1758378598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's important for us to build the game the community wants, so Blood Moon Massacre will launch in Early Access to gather player feedback as early in the development cycle as possible. Currently there are two playable survivors and two maps in Blood Moon Massacre, but new survivors, maps, weapons, classes, and multiplayer will be added over time. Sometime after launch, a road map will be posted.</p>","developers":["Siphon Shock"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":